msgid "Imagify has optimized %s worth of images this month. Upgrade to the <a>Growth</a> plan to continue optimizing and keep your site running fast."
msgstr "Imagify on sel kuul optimeerinud %s pilte. Mine üle <a>Growth</a> paketile, et jätkata optimeerimist ja hoida sait kiirena."

#. translators: %1$s is an image's file size before Imagify made it smaller, like 1.2 MB; %2$s is its size after, like 318 KB; %3$s is how much smaller it got, like 74%. Shown on a card in the AI Agent's chat right after the user added an image to their website.
